    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TWA's New\nSKY COACH SERVICE\nLos Angeles • Phoenix • Albuquerque\nAmarillo • Wichita • Kansas City\n(In addition to regular fare TWA Luxury Service)\nEASTBOUND\nRead Down\nTwe\nFlights Nightly\nEach Way\nWESTBOUND\nRead Up\n7:05\n10:15\n10:25\n12:30\n12:40\n3:20\n3:30\n5:15\n5:25\n6:35\n9:15 LV Los Angeles\nAR\n6:45\n12:25\nAR Phoenix\nLV\n5:25\n12:35\nLV Phoenix\nAR\n5:15\n2:40\nAR Albuquerque\nLV\n3:00\n2:50\nLV Albuquerque\nAR\n2:50\n5:30\nAR Amarillo\nLV\n2:00\n5:40\nLV Amarillo\nAR\n1:50\n7:25\nAR Wichita\nLV\n11:55\n7:35\nLV Wichita\nAR\n11:45\n8:45\nAR Kansas City\nLV\n10:30\n8:25\n7:05\n6:55\n4:40\n4:30\n3:40\n3:30\n1:35\n1:25\n12:10\nLIGHT FACE indicates AM - DARK FACE indicates PM\nAll times shown are local standard times.\nFacts on TWA Sky Coach Service:\n1. The speed of air travel, at a big saving in\nmoney.\n2. Scheduled airline dependability and safety, with\na crew of three on every flight.\n3. Dependable 24-passenger Douglas DC-3's.\n4. Ticket must be purchased to reserve space.\nTWA\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINE\nU. 8.A. • EUROPE • AFRICA• ASIA",
